  "discussion": {
    "headline": "cooler, less humid and more seasonable this weekend",
    "dateLine": "11:30 a.m. Friday, October 6, 2026, Update",
    "excerpt": "Once again, the Lower Susquehanna Valley essentially got missed on all flanks by substantial rainfall since Wednesday night. A measly 0.10-0.25\" of rain fell across most of south-central PA, while as much as 1-2\" was recorded in the I-95 corridor near Baltimore and Philadelphia (see below). Following our early-morning showers, clouds will continue to decrease from southwest-to-northeast through the early-afternoon hours. …",
